    <description>N123: edits the amount buttons of the donation form (Shacharit and Mincha) and the donor page, Cardcom_Setting__mdt.Default.Amount_Presets__c (AmountPresetsAction). Gated by Custom Permission Manage_Amount_Presets (also checked in Apex).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
